{"id": "msg_48cac7dd8f5b4f80a1d974b10d2aa536", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8b0b54d64d5a5d97", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\select.json (Lines 29-178 of 323) ===\n[Notice: revision=48794cda441d468a7bafc68854e3e6c785082ebc5f32d5ffe2d978d664d05409; bytes=59352.]\n29 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/苏州市房地产监测v3/branch_cancel_dialog.md\",\n30 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n31 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n32 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"2b6b773a0461471a\",\n33 |       \"content\": \"# 分支机构注销弹窗改造\\\\n苏州市房地产监测V3 已按设计稿完成「分支机构注销」弹窗改造，新增附件上传组件并调整弹窗。\\\\n\\\\n## 新增组件\\\\n- `AppendixPictureUpload.vue`：通过 `listAppendixPackage` 加载要件，卡片式 `picture-card` 上传，仍走 `/file/appendix/upload`\\\\n- 右侧提示：「请上传 大小不超过 5MB 格式为 jpg/png/pdf 的文件」\\\\n- 删除使用 `before-remove`，失败时不从列表移除；`uid` 与并发 `loadSeq` 已处理\\\\n\\\\n## 弹窗更新\\\\n- `CancelDialog.vue`：`form-box` + `label-position=\\\\\"right\\\\\"`\\\\n- 注销时间 placeholder：**请选择时间**\\\\n- 「注销材料」改为必填 **附件**，接入 `AppendixPictureUpload`\\\\n- 主按钮文案：**确认**；提交逻辑不变：`validate` → 提交\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 涉及文件：`src/views/institution/agencyBranch/components/AppendixPictureUpload.vue`、`CancelDialog.vue`\\\\n- 所属项目：苏州市房地产监测V3；来源会话：485a0b05-80d5-45aa-91a0-e2f3e44801ed；验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏州市房地产监测V3\"\n34 |     },\n35 |     {\n36 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/rectification_dict_fix.md\",\n37 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n38 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n39 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"6249d826fd44a987\",\n40 |       \"content\": \"# 整改通知书业务状态字典统一修复\\\\n苏住房G项目修复整改通知书列表因字典不一致导致「已备案/审核中」筛选结果相反的缺陷。\\\\n\\\\n## 问题根因\\\\n- 查询条件下拉使用 BIZ_STATE 字典，其中「已备案」与「审核中」值与后端不一致\\\\n- 列表展示使用 biz_state 全局字典（1=审核中，2=已备案）\\\\n- 选「已备案」实际传 status=1 查出审核中数据，选「审核中」传 status=2 查出已备案数据\\\\n\\\\n## 修复方案\\\\n- 在 rectificationNotice/index.vue 将业务状态字典统一为 biz_state\\\\n- 与同模块申诉、修复页面及列表展示逻辑保持一致\\\\n- 修复后选「已备案」传 bizState=2，选「审核中」传 bizState=1\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 所属项目：苏住房G；来源会话：d13d65c9-9c9c-46c7-a385-c74d24a4cbbb\\\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房G；涉及 rectificationNotice/index.vue 等\"\n41 |     },\n42 |     {\n43 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/小程序技术/zsimage_zero_height.md\",\n44 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n45 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n46 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"a71b530c3fea2e0e\",\n47 |       \"content\": \"# ZsImage组件默认高度导致图片不显示\\\\n苏住房C的ZsImage封装默认aspectFill+height:100%，父级无高度时图片渲染为0高，需补width prop与widthFix。\\\\n\\\\n## 问题现象\\\\n- 页面插图请求返回200但界面看不到图，误以为资源丢失或路径错\\\\n- 报错Failed to load local image resource ... 500与307重定向到/__pageframe__\\\\n\\\\n## 根因\\\\n- ZsImage默认mode=aspectFill+内部height:100%，父容器无显式高度时盒高压成0\\\\n- 小程序自定义组件默认styleIsolation隔离，父级width:180px进不到组件内部真实节点\\\\n\\\\n## 解决方案\\\\n- 给ZsImage补width prop，内部inline style落到真实节点，支持mode=\\\\\"widthFix\\\\\"高度自适应\\\\n- 调用侧统一写`<ZsImage mode=\\\\\"widthFix\\\\\" width=\\\\\"180px\\\\\" />`\\\\n- 需外部样式生效时组件options改styleIsolation:'shared'并合并外部class，补全空引用imageStyle\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 会话a875a\n\n[...]\n\ntore (dbxenc1)\\\\nDBX desktop database client keeps connection passwords in an app-encrypted local store and only uses them internally, so its query tools never reveal them.\\\\n\\\\n## Storage layout\\\\n- DBX is installed at D:\\\\\\\\DBX and ships as a single bundled ~90 MB binary.\\\\n- Connection store is the SQLite file dbx.db, with `connections` and `connection_secrets` tables; secret values carry the `dbxenc1.` prefix.\\\\n- Envelope shape `dbxenc1.<iv:12 bytes>.<ciphertext+tag>` matches an AEAD cipher; the binary uses Rust `ring` (AES-256-GCM / ChaCha20-Poly1305).\\\\n- App strings reference secret store id `com.dbx.app.secret-store.v1` and a `local-data-encryption-key`.\\\\n\\\\n## Key handling\\\\n- The 32-byte data key sits in Windows Credential Manager as `local-data-encryption-key.com.dbx.app.secret-store.v1`, protected by DPAPI.\\\\n- Decryption attempts on 2026-11-24 with that key (direct GCM, HKDF variants, AAD variants, stream modes) all failed; the exact derivation/AAD remains unknown.\\\\n- The duplicate-connection tool copies full settings including credentials but does not return plaintext.\\\\n\\\\n## Practical implications\\\\n- `dbx_execute_query` with `connection_name` can still query through the stored credentials, so DB work does not require the plaintext password.\\\\n- On 2026-11-24 both known candidates (SYSDBA on the Suzhou dev host and on the alternate 苏住房 dev host 172.9.1.1) were rejected by 达梦 with 用户名或密码错误 (errorCode -2501) until the user supplied the correct password.\\\\n- Recovering the password from the encrypted store is not worth further budget; ask the user instead.\"\n167 |     },\n168 |     {\n169 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/无锡市区小程序嵌入h5技术/sfb_face_auth_json_fix.md\",\n170 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n171 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n172 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"5462177d465dd88d\",\n173 |       \"content\": \"# 苏服办人脸识别回调JSON字符串修复\\\\n苏服办SDK的success回调返回JSON字符串而非对象，导致人脸识别被误判失败，已在sfbFaceAuth.js修复。\\\\n\\\\n## 问题根因\\\\n- 苏服办SDK的success回调返回JSON字符串（如{\\\\\"retcode\\\\\":\\\\\"000000\\\\\",\\\\\"msg\\\\\":\\\\\"认证成功\\\\\"}）而非对象\\\\n- 原代码直接读data.retcode得到undefined，被误判为失败\\\\n\\\\n## 修复方案\\\\n- sfbFaceAuth.js新增normalizeSfbFaceResponse：若返回值为字符串先JSON.parse再判断\\\\n- isSfbFaceSuccess满足retcode==='000000'或msg==='认证成功'任一即视为成功\\\\n- 识别成功后正常走goBdc()并带verifyResult=true跳转不动产授权页\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=无锡市区小程序嵌入H5\\\\n- 所属项目：无锡市区小程序嵌入H5；来源会话：9641a1de-5bbe-4afe-a7ab-487324afb826\\\\n- 涉及文件：src/utils/sfbFaceAuth.js、src/pages/face/bdc.vue、src/pages/face/face.vue\\\\n- 代码基线：none\"\n174 |     },\n175 |     {\n176 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/惠山小程序技术模式/benefit_analyse_api.md\",\n177 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n178 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n[Notice: 150 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; nextOffset=179; omitted=145; matched=323; failed=0.]\n\n(Omitted 22414 bytes. Full formatted result stored at: C:\\Users\\ADMINI~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\dsh-spill-vBjhs7\\session-4eaa74a971f9\\87802008fe87-ops_inspect_local_file.txt. Use read with offset/limit, or grep this path to search within it.)", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_48cac7dd8f5b4f80a1d974b10d2aa536", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 5933, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T18:35:02.040Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
